{"id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-sieve-pullback.md","title":"Definition — Pullback of a Sieve","display":"Definition — Pullback of a Sieve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-sieve-pullback","aliases":["14-df-sieve-pullback"],"display":"Definition — Pullback of a Sieve","depends_on":["[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-morphism]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-sieve-pullback"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-sieve-pullback</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Pullback of a Sieve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\)</span> (sieve, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C&#39;,C)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C&#39;,C)\\)</span> (morphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{cod}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{cod}\\)</span> (morphism set and target map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullSieve}\">\\(\\mathrm{PullSieve}\\)</span> (pullback-sieve operation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,S)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=C&#39;\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\in S\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,S)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=C&#39;\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\in S\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2 Grothendieck Topologies。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 属于所写集合且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 可与之复合，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fg\\in S\">\\(fg\\in S\\)</span>，由筛封闭性得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fgh\\in S\">\\(fgh\\in S\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gh\">\\(gh\\)</span> 仍属于逆像筛。结合律给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullSieve}(g,\\mathrm{PullSieve}(f,S))=\\mathrm{PullSieve}(fg,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{PullSieve}(g,\\mathrm{PullSieve}(f,S))=\\mathrm{PullSieve}(fg,S)\\)</span>。无需实际拉回对象存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)$ (sieve, see [[14-df-sieve]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C',C)$ (morphism, see [[14-df-morphism]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{cod}$ (morphism set and target map, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C',C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{cod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PullSieve}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,S)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=C'\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\in S\\}","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"fg\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"fgh\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"gh","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PullSieve}(g,\\mathrm{PullSieve}(f,S))=\\mathrm{PullSieve}(fg,S)","display":false}],"bytes":1208,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback|Definition — Pullback of a Sieve]]"},{"id":"f51bc0e57c805ccf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]"},{"id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PullSieve}$ (pullback-sieve operation, see [[14-df-sieve-pullback]])"},{"id":"365bea28fb7d89a0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e1782799288dd0ec","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴；$P$ 为预层，$A\\subseteq P$ 为实际子预层，故 $A(C)\\subseteq P(C)$ 且限制为 $P$ 限制在这些子集上的函数。$C,D$ 为对象，$u:D\\to C$。筛、极大筛和筛逆像采用 [[14-df-sieve]]、[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]；$1$ 为 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 中逐点取 $\\{*\\}$ 的终预层。自然变换均采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的带源靶三元组。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback|Definition — Pullback of a Sieve]]"},{"id":"d09d6567cd8efb10","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5d8dd49e5f3240a8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3ac28cc449b6cd1f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J$ 是 [[14-df-grothendieck-topology]] 的 Grothendieck 拓扑；$\\operatorname{PullSieve}(f,S)$ 见 [[14-df-sieve-pullback]]；$j$ 的 LT 条件在 $\\widehat{\\mathcal C}$ 内解释。"}],"outgoing":["74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","28211adc1b0ce5bc","5c54520